{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016GZm1Km6kGNEneuLYDa5ie","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-14\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- baseline-llm-judge（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **probe-multiseed** (success): —\\\\n- **baseline-meanpool-lr** (success): —\\\\n- **probe-002** (success): —\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 5 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 5\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nautodl-5090: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1\\\\ngpu-5090-2x-2: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 361, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01U2bXe4Pf8NggsEPqSUXT33","session_id":"f0157715-28cd-4094-a367-772100c08664","uuid":"975b8224-62f6-4410-b273-c7f1c8a2e13a","timestamp":"2026-05-14T10:40:32.069Z"}
